{"about_the_game":"Lord of the Click is a 2D TopDown Clicker with strategy elements. The game takes you to the middle ages. You can feel yourself in the role of a brave Prince who fulfills the decree of the king to liberate their lands from the forces of darkness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe path of liberation of their lands from evil begins uncomplicated and laid gradually. Upgrade your tower, build mandatory structures for its functioning, ensure the extraction of resources and do not forget about the soldiers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main feature of Lord of the Click - bright and stylish pixel graphics, with which it was possible to create a truly fabulous location and memorable characters. The gameplay combines fascinating fights &quot;wall to wall&quot; to the accompaniment of serene clicks on the entire playing field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURE OF GAME:<br />\r\n- 7 levels to pass<br />\r\n- 7 types of enemies<br />\r\n- more than 10 subspecies of enemies armed with a variety of weapons<br />\r\n- stylish, bright, pixel graphics<br />\r\n- dashing soundtracks from Hatebit","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0708f555e12c7ece9c4a2b16ed631a7f32a71d12.jpg","localized_name":"Disciple","name":"Disciple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1044170/0708f555e12c7ece9c4a2b16ed631a7f32a71d12.jpg"},{"icon":"e8fbe93ea8ae255e5e51668166f5b73ddbfc2457.jpg","localized_name":"Inanimate","name":"Inanimate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1044170/e8fbe93ea8ae255e5e51668166f5b73ddbfc2457.jpg"},{"icon":"884db1e66eb0f513eb428dd5e14bfada9c78fdfe.jpg","localized_name":"Horde","name":"Horde","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1044170/884db1e66eb0f513eb428dd5e14bfada9c78fdfe.jpg"},{"icon":"deefd18a7c3989fa573814b712880fdd0abf14cf.jpg","localized_name":"Horns and hooves","name":"Horns and hooves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im